@@ -0,0 +1,41 @@
+# AI Project Copilot v2.1.1 hardening
+
+This patch is based on `main` commit `e3d6c7d`.
+
+## Fixed
+
+- Avoids feeding attacker-controlled or malformed deeply nested JSON directly to
+  the CPython JSON parser. A string-aware depth guard now rejects nesting above
+  256 containers before parsing.
+- Handles malformed issue JSON as a clean CLI usage error.
+- Rejects dangling symlinks before writing generated project documents,
+  AI-agent instruction files, or integrity manifests.
+- Replaces timing-sensitive SQLite and lease-renewal tests with event-based
+  synchronization.
+- Makes CI diagnostics deterministic and records Python/SQLite runtime details.
+
+## Repository cleanup
+
+The previous `fix` and `fix2.0` commits stored delivery artifacts in the source
+tree instead of applying them. After applying this patch, remove those tracked
+artifacts before committing:
+
+```bash
+git rm -r --ignore-unmatch ai-project-copilot-patch
+git rm --ignore-unmatch ai-project-copilot-fixed-source.zip
+git rm --ignore-unmatch ai-project-copilot-repair-from-245cefc.patch
+git rm --ignore-unmatch SHA256SUMS.txt
+```
+
+The new `.gitignore` entries prevent the same packaging mistake from recurring.
+
+## Verification
+
+```bash
+git apply --check ai-project-copilot-v2.1.1-hardening.patch
+git apply ai-project-copilot-v2.1.1-hardening.patch
+python tools/validate_skill.py skills/ai-project-copilot
+python skills/ai-project-copilot/scripts/run_skill_evals.py --format json
+python -m unittest discover -s tests -v
+python -m compileall -q tools tests skills/ai-project-copilot/scripts
+```
